{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1493,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"LORD, you God to whom vengeance belongs, you God to whom vengeance belongs, shine out.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5142},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1494,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Rise up, you judge of the earth. Pay back the proud what they deserve.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5145},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1495,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"LORD, how long will the wicked, how long will the wicked triumph?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5148},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1496,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"They pour out arrogant words. All the evildoers boast.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5151},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1497,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"They break your people in pieces, LORD, and afflict your heritage.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5154},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1498,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"They kill the widow and the alien, and murder the fatherless.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5157},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1499,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"They say, “The LORD will not see, neither will Jacob’s God consider.”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5160},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1500,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"Consider, you senseless among the people; you fools, when will you be wise?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5163},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1501,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"He who implanted the ear, won’t he hear? He who formed the eye, won’t he see?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5166},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1502,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"He who disciplines the nations, won’t he punish? He who teaches man knows.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5169},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1503,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"The LORD knows the thoughts of man, that they are futile.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5172},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1504,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"Blessed is the man whom you discipline, LORD, and teach out of your law,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5175},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1505,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"that you may give him rest from the days of adversity, until the pit is dug for the wicked.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5178},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1506,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"For the LORD won’t reject his people, neither will he forsake his inheritance.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5181},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1507,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"For judgment will return to righteousness. All the upright in heart shall follow it.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5184},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1508,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"Who will rise up for me against the wicked? Who will stand up for me against the evildoers?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5187},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1509,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"Unless the LORD had been my help, my soul would have soon lived in silence.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5190},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1510,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"When I said, “My foot is slipping!” Your loving kindness, LORD, held me up.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5193},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1511,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"In the multitude of my thoughts within me, your comforts delight my soul.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5196},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1512,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"Shall the throne of wickedness have fellowship with you, which brings about mischief by statute?","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5199},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1513,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"They gather themselves together against the soul of the righteous, and condemn the innocent blood.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5202},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1514,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"But the LORD has been my high tower, my God, the rock of my refuge.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5205},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":94,"verse_ordinal":1515,"verse_start":23,"verse_end":23,"verse_label":"23","text":"He has brought on them their own iniquity, and will cut them off in their own wickedness. The LORD, our God, will cut them off.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5208}]}